{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/extras/f687dd6646fcb14002fbbb159cf7ab2a.poster.avif?t=1758065327\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/extras/f687dd6646fcb14002fbbb159cf7ab2a.webm?t=1758065327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FEARS</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by old school FPS games, Bloodfire lets you experience the layers of hell in the most brutal and satisfying way possible. You play as a seeker, trying to escape from the divine punishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave through countless enemies with a fluid and expanding movement system, with 3D positional audio, so you know exactly where your next target is. Go through the seven layers of hell, complete with unique enemies and bosses, and survive for as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/extras/8198a31c751585ac6e892b38bcdf52c5.poster.avif?t=1758065327\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/extras/8198a31c751585ac6e892b38bcdf52c5.webm?t=1758065327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/extras/8198a31c751585ac6e892b38bcdf52c5.mp4?t=1758065327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPETE</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain combos and get the highest score possible to climb up the leaderboards. With instant respawns, you stay immersed in the action. Challenge your friends or other fellow seekers, and become hell's undisputed champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Seek a fellow seeker's earlier replays with a unique replay system, and drop in their previously played game as you wish to! You can save your favorite replays as well to view later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/extras/58f853a51ede93173b8ba65cf66bbc17.poster.avif?t=1758065327\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/extras/58f853a51ede93173b8ba65cf66bbc17.webm?t=1758065327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU WILL DIE</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill. Die. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunnyhop, dash and parry through an endless legion of hellspawn, all inspired by old paintings and literature. From demonic centipedes to bloodthirsty maggots, your skills will be tested to the extreme. Choose from seven unsettling arenas, all complete with different play styles, mechanics and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you cross the layers of hell and prove yourself worthy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584970?t=1758065327","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/e375e64f593493dcfa11367f3405c5b43b6dcc79/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758065327","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/6fa562df15b7cc997931b3dfd0d15bcba2086c2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758065327","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/6fa562df15b7cc997931b3dfd0d15bcba2086c2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758065327","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains over the top violence and gore."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/extras/f687dd6646fcb14002fbbb159cf7ab2a.poster.avif?t=1758065327\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/extras/f687dd6646fcb14002fbbb159cf7ab2a.webm?t=1758065327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FEARS</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by old school FPS games, Bloodfire lets you experience the layers of hell in the most brutal and satisfying way possible. You play as a seeker, trying to escape from the divine punishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave through countless enemies with a fluid and expanding movement system, with 3D positional audio, so you know exactly where your next target is. Go through the seven layers of hell, complete with unique enemies and bosses, and survive for as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/extras/8198a31c751585ac6e892b38bcdf52c5.poster.avif?t=1758065327\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/extras/8198a31c751585ac6e892b38bcdf52c5.webm?t=1758065327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/extras/8198a31c751585ac6e892b38bcdf52c5.mp4?t=1758065327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPETE</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain combos and get the highest score possible to climb up the leaderboards. With instant respawns, you stay immersed in the action. Challenge your friends or other fellow seekers, and become hell's undisputed champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Seek a fellow seeker's earlier replays with a unique replay system, and drop in their previously played game as you wish to! You can save your favorite replays as well to view later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/extras/58f853a51ede93173b8ba65cf66bbc17.poster.avif?t=1758065327\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/extras/58f853a51ede93173b8ba65cf66bbc17.webm?t=1758065327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU WILL DIE</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill. Die. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunnyhop, dash and parry through an endless legion of hellspawn, all inspired by old paintings and literature. From demonic centipedes to bloodthirsty maggots, your skills will be tested to the extreme. Choose from seven unsettling arenas, all complete with different play styles, mechanics and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you cross the layers of hell and prove yourself worthy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Unquittable Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/a2033f5e6107fd7c76412f1ab3386c186f33d43c/header.jpg?t=1758065327","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3584970/872717717/b2df5925fc1877018bb799d7d85699f5bdd8101f/1758000158/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758002585","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3584970/872717717/b2df5925fc1877018bb799d7d85699f5bdd8101f/1758000158/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758002585","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3584970/872717717/b2df5925fc1877018bb799d7d85699f5bdd8101f/1758000158/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758002585","id":257123607,"name":"Bloodfire trailer v2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123607/ade6caa4b25246852e14ee9247835577841a8a8f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758002585"}],"name":"Bloodfire","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3220 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> None</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul c