ef60982d5b84099f8f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758065327","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/8a34087e5031007be5b260ef60982d5b84099f8f/ss_8a34087e5031007be5b260ef60982d5b84099f8f.600x338.jpg?t=1758065327"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/9c51b71613dcafaf9aa445548bba86f879b44781/ss_9c51b71613dcafaf9aa445548bba86f879b44781.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758065327","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/9c51b71613dcafaf9aa445548bba86f879b44781/ss_9c51b71613dcafaf9aa445548bba86f879b44781.600x338.jpg?t=1758065327"}],"short_description":"A fast paced, old school arena shooter with satisfying movement and precise gunplay. Fight through endless legions of demons and become the undisputed champion of hell.","steam_appid":3584970,"support_info":{"email":"unquittablestudios@gmail.com","url":"https://www.unquittablestudios.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.unquittablestudios.com"}